msgctxt "128"
msgid "The Assault on Yoshiharu Ueno"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "140"
msgid "1. Case Overview"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "152"
msgid "The attempt on Yoshiharu Ueno's life was carried out\\r\non April 21, 1985."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
#. y4:translated_by=MasterCry
msgctxt "164"
msgid "Shortly after 12:00 noon that day, a lone gunman\\r\narmed with six revolvers burst into a ramen shop\\r\nlocated in Tokyo's Suginami Ward."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "176"
msgid "Yoshiharu Ueno, chairman of the Ueno Seiwa Clan, was one of\\r\nthe 20 men shot inside, and one of the two who survived."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "188"
msgid "The gunman was one Taiga Saejima, a 20-year-old\\r\nmember of the Tojo Clan."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "200"
msgid "On the day of the incident, Ueno had just been\\r\nreleased after serving a two-year prison term.\\r\nWith him were several top members of his clan."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "224"
msgid "2. Investigation"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "236"
msgid "The Tokyo Metropolitan Police Department formed\\r\na special investigation team led by detectives\\r\n<Color:7>Taigi Tanimura<Color:Default> and <Color:7>Junji Sugiuchi<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

